<title>UK: TENNIS-SEMIFINAL RESULTS AT LONDON GRASS-COURT CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SEMIFINAL RESULTS AT LONDON GRASS-COURT CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at the men's</p>
<p>London Grass Court Championship at the Queen's Club on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>6-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat 8-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden)</p>
<p>2-6 7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat 16-Greg Rusedski (Britian)</p>
<p>beat 4-6 6-4 7-6 (20-18)</p>
</text>
